{"parentUuid":"6eda9242-8862-41d8-b66c-2bfe6403a7cc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFdhQEhApiT82UVGHrhQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Claude Code research is back. Its main points come from the docs:\n\n- **`CLAUDE_ENV_FILE`:** Claude runs this script before every Bash command, in the same shell, and you can set it before launching Claude.\n- **Hooks:** `SessionStart`, `CwdChanged` and `FileChanged` hooks can rewrite that file.\n- **Official recipe:** the Claude Code hooks guide has a direnv example that runs `direnv export` from those hooks.\n\nThe simpler alternative is a static env file that runs `direnv export` itself before every command. That handles directory changes and every file nix-direnv watches (not only `flake.nix`), without hooks, and works the same way the Codex side probably will. The trade-off is per-command cost, so I'll measure it on one of your real projects:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2457,"cache_read_input_tokens":231721,"output_tokens":3691,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3192},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2457,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":3691,"cache_read_input_tokens":231721,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2457,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2457},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0872cb50-8cac-43de-9b93-d3773060f969","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFdhPu79EFADDSr7q1Y8","requestRef":"5fc250d2-51ae-4a0f-a119-d5117b195325","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistan