{"parentUuid":"647b324b-3e97-4da9-bdaa-7f6a73e72a67","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFdoPDLtfyEUT444BDmA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With info logging off, direnv stays quiet in normal use. Real errors still come through: in a project whose `.envrc` isn't allowed, the agent sees direnv's own \"is blocked. Run `direnv allow`\" message, so it can tell you rather than fail silently.\n\nThe design is settled on the Claude side. Its wrapper will set `CLAUDE_ENV_FILE` to a small Nix-store script that runs `direnv export` before each command. That covers directory changes and every file nix-direnv watches. I'm waiting on the Codex research to see whether Codex's shells read `.zshenv`, which decides the hook point for Codex."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3286,"cache_read_input_tokens":240686,"output_tokens":2411,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2201},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3286,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2411,"cache_read_input_tokens":240686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3286,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3286},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b7b6eefd-f046-4c0a-917a-da0afa90c8d4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFdoNt1WXYDVHGKAZEjS","requestRef":"8af228c1-9593-4ad1-a5c8-dd646fac59cd","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"aeb18fff-6ce5-4ee8-9d0d-79b6e9f1bd54","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:41:10.613Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","session_id