{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"5177785d-cd1e-4fc5-a113-5f63d7df1406","hash":"23fbf1c4201bfe484def7d0c4dbb67ddf7803a38f788fac2c46488384d9b3f0a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Two changes:\n\n1. **Agent tools:** add markitdown, tesseract with pytesseract, ghostscript and ImageMagick.\n2. **Claude's shells:** remove the aliases there.\n\nBefore editing, two checks. ImageMagick's default nixpkgs build may lack the ghostscript delegate, so I'll see what the doc skills use `magick` for. For the aliases, I need to know where Home Manager writes them in `.zshrc`, so a removal block lands after them. Claude Code sets `CLAUDECODE=1`, which I'll verify reaches the shell it captures."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016YqUZjUhz6itGhxRYgsvAC","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"oai=/nix/store/REDACTED/skills/.curated; ant=$(command ls -d ~/.claude/skills/synced/*/ | head -1); dirs=(\"$oai/slides\" \"$oai/doc\" \"${ant}docx\" \"${ant}pdf\" \"${ant}pptx\" \"${ant}xlsx\"); echo \"=== magick/gs/inkscape/tesseract usage:\"; command grep -rn -w -E \"magick|gs|inkscape|rsvg-convert|tesseract|markitdown\" \"${dirs[@]}\" 2>/dev/null | command grep -v \"^Binary\" | cut -c1-200 | sed \"s|$oai|oai|; s|$ant|ant/|\" | head -20; cd /home/thom/src/github.com/tteggel/.dotfiles && echo \"=== imagemagick variants:\"; for a in imagemagick imagemagickBig; do printf '%-15s %s\\n' $a \"$(nix eval --json \".#nixosConfigurations.thixos.pkgs.$a.override.__functionArgs\" 2>/dev/null | jq -c 'keys | map(select(test(\"ghostscript|librsvg|libheif|openexr\")))' 2>/dev/null)\"; done; nix eval --raw '.#nixosConfigurations.thixos.pkgs.imagemagickBig.name' 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Check how skills use magick, gs, tesseract"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kx3XisTvEkjGd7HFtXaaSS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/thom/src/github.com/tteggel/.dotfiles && hm=$(nix eval --raw '.#nixosConfigurations.thixos.config.home-manager.users.thom.home.homeDirectory' >/dev/null 2>&1; nix flake metadata --json 2>/dev/null | jq -r '.locks.nodes[\"home-manager\"].locked | \"github:\\(.owner)/\\(.repo)/\\(.rev)\"'); src=$(nix flake prefetch --json \"$hm\" 2>/dev/null | jq -r .storePath); echo \"hm source: $src\"; command grep -n -E \"mkOrder|aliasesStr|shellAliases|initContent\" $src/modules/programs/zsh/default.nix 2>/dev/null | head -30 || ls $src/modules/programs | command grep zsh","description":"Find alias order in Home Manager zsh module"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
