{"parentUuid":"5c21b2a3-af1d-4211-99be-b9d9d5b72af1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFhsajEGeM9ptedSGiYW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"markitdown now converts both `.docx` and `.xlsx`. The spreadsheet's formula cell shows no value because no spreadsheet app has ever calculated and saved it. That's expected for a file written by openpyxl.\n\nBoth changes are built, and `thixos` and `yoloixos` both evaluate.\n\n**Aliases removed from Claude's shells** (`home/shell.nix`)\n- When `CLAUDECODE` is set, `.zshrc` now removes every alias from `shellAliases` (`ls`, `cat`, `grep`, `find`, `ll`, `la`, `lt`). Claude Code sets that variable in the shell it snapshots; I confirmed this in its binary. Your own shells keep all the aliases.\n- Claude already replaces `grep` and `find` with its own functions, so the practical change is that `ls` and `cat` are the real commands again.\n- I tested the built `.zshrc` directly. Claude always reads `~/.zshrc`, so the live check has to wait until you deploy. After that, `type ls` in a new Claude session should show a path, not `eza`.\n\n**Optional packages added** (`home/doc-tools.nix`, agent wrappers only)\n- **markitdown:** with its docx, pptx, xlsx, xls, PDF and Outlook extras. A test `.docx` and `.xlsx` both converted.\n- **tesseract and pytesseract:** all 129 languages. It read back the text \"Optical 2026\" correctly from an image that ImageMagick drew.\n- **ghostscript and ImageMagick:** both installed and running.\n- markitdown prints a harmless onnxruntime GPU-detection warning each time it runs.\n\nThere's one more tool the doc skills can use: Inkscape. OpenAI's `slides` skill uses it to convert SVG and EMF images into PNGs. Say if you want it.\n\n**To deploy:** run `sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake ~/src/github.com/tteggel/.dotfiles#thixos`, then start new Claude and Codex sessions. Nothing is committed yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2509,"cache_read_input_tokens":432390,"output_tokens":1507,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":814},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2509,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1507,"cache_read_input_tokens":432390,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2509},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6940f2a3-7943-4577-908f-1270e3a44a2f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFhsZvMkn5dcRKWtY3Xt","requestRef":"da5f33e7-a235-4c61-956d-6b36e203c10d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8279717d-ae7a-4c12-ba8a-1229e9ae8923","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:34:26.300Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","session_id":"ff4c36dc-31b6-4ffc-a570-c7ff2f63f5ce","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/thom/src/github.com/tteggel/.dotfiles","sessionId":"5177785d-cd1e-4fc5-a113-5f63d7df1406","version":"2.1.302","gitBranch":"master"}
